# Keep build contexts small and never ship secrets into an image.
.git
.github
docs
scripts
infra/aws
# Terraform state and provider downloads must never enter a Docker build context.
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/venv
**/.venv
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.DS_Store
*.tar.gz
